# CLIP image-search weights (~86 MB), populated by
# `pnpm embeddings:fetch-model` and bundled into the /api/search/image function
# via outputFileTracingIncludes. Kept out of git so the repository does not
# carry an 86 MB binary; `prebuild` repopulates it on every build.
# Commit this line out if your build environment cannot reach the Hugging Face
# Hub and you would rather have the weights in the repository.
/models
